  "term": "ApoE",
  "definition": "ApoE refers to apolipoprotein E, discussed here in terms of its genetic forms and their links to cognitive impairment risk. In this source, the APOE4 form is associated with conditions involving cognitive problems, including Alzheimer’s disease and chemotherapy-related cognitive impairment, and with altered excitatory–inhibitory signaling in the entorhinal cortex.",
